    "totalDuration": "3 mos",
    "description": "I planned, designed, and developed a system module that expanded the existing Ushahidi open source, crowdsourcing platform for crisis management. Ushahidi is a system to collect data from various sources for the purpose of visualizing it in a map or timeline. I expanded the Ushahidi system with a module to allow professional contri- butions, manage situation-specific help requests, and close the communication loop between volunteer users and non- governmental organization staff. The module employs a competitive incentive model to keep users engaged and promote high-quality contributions.",
